<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Static Stripes</span></h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Static stripes are single stripes captured by the ModelMaker sensor  see</span> <u><span lang="EN-GB"><a href="Scan_Data_Description.htm">Scan Data Description</a></span></u> <span lang="EN-GB">for details about stripes. A static stripe is a linear sequence of points. Every stripe has a 2D profile corresponding to the laser line on the surface at the moment of capturing.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Use</b></span> <span class="Command">Capture Static Stripes</span> <span lang="EN-GB">command to generate static stripes.</span></p>
